{"title": "A circular queue: fixed array, wrapping indexes", "view": "array", "steps": [{"array": ["\u00b7", "\u00b7", "\u00b7", "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 0}, "highlight": [], "vars": {"count": 0}, "caption": "Circular queue of size 4: a fixed array plus head and count. Indexes wrap around with % 4."}, {"array": [1, "\u00b7", "\u00b7", "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 0, "tail": 0}, "highlight": [0], "vars": {"count": 1}, "caption": "enQueue(1): write at (head + count) % 4 = 0."}, {"array": [1, 2, "\u00b7", "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 0, "tail": 1}, "highlight": [0, 1], "vars": {"count": 2}, "caption": "enQueue(2): write at (head + count) % 4 = 1."}, {"array": [1, 2, 3, "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 0, "tail": 2}, "highlight": [0, 1, 2], "vars": {"count": 3}, "caption": "enQueue(3): write at (head + count) % 4 = 2."}, {"array": ["\u00b7", 2, 3, "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 1, "tail": 2}, "highlight": [1, 2], "vars": {"count": 2}, "caption": "deQueue(): remove 1 at the front, head = (head + 1) % 4 = 1. Nothing shifts."}, {"array": ["\u00b7", "\u00b7", 3, "\u00b7"], "pointers": {"head": 2, "tail": 2}, "highlight": [2], "vars": {"count": 1}, "caption": "deQueue(): remove 2 at the front, head = (head + 1) % 4 = 2. Nothing shifts."}, {"array": ["\u00b7", "\u00b7", 3, 4], "pointers": {"head": 2, "tail": 3}, "highlight": [2, 3], "vars": {"count": 2}, "caption": "enQueue(4): write at (head + count) % 4 = 3."}, {"array": [5, "\u00b7", 3, 4], "pointers": {"head": 2, "tail": 0}, "highlight": [2, 3, 0], "vars": {"count": 3}, "caption": "enQueue(5): write at (head + count) % 4 = 0. It wrapped around to the front of the array."}, {"array": [5, 6, 3, 4], "pointers": {"head": 2, "tail": 1}, "highlight": [2, 3, 0, 1], "vars": {"count": 4}, "caption": "enQueue(6): write at (head + count) % 4 = 1. It wrapped around to the front of the array."}]}
